  "items": [
    {
      "source": "If a test is not enabled, this method will abort further evaluation\nof the execution chain with a failed assumption; otherwise, this method\nwill simply evaluate the next <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a> in the execution chain.",
      "translation": "如果测试未启用，此方法将以失败的假设中止执行链的进一步评估；否则，此方法将简单地评估执行链中的下一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the test is not annotated with <code>@IfProfileValue</code> it is\nconsidered enabled.",
      "translation": "如果测试未使用 `<code>@IfProfileValue</code>` 进行注解，则视为已启用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ProfileValueChecker</code> is a custom JUnit <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a> that checks\nwhether a test class or test method is enabled in the current environment\nvia Spring's <a href=\"../../../annotation/IfProfileValue.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.annotation\"><code>@IfProfileValue</code></a> annotation.",
      "translation": "<code>ProfileValueChecker</code> 是一个自定义的 JUnit <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runners/model/Statement.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runners.model\"><code>Statement</code></a>，它通过 Spring 的 <a href=\"../../../annotation/IfProfileValue.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.annotation\"><code>@IfProfileValue</code></a> 注解检查测试类或测试方法在当前环境中是否已启用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine if the test specified by arguments to the\n<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.junit.runners.model.Statement,java.lang.Class,java.lang.reflect.Method)\">constructor</a> is <em>enabled</em> in\nthe current environment, as configured via the <a href=\"../../../annotation/IfProfileValue.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.annotation\"><code>@IfProfileValue</code></a> annotation.",
      "translation": "确定由传递给<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.junit.runners.model.Statement,java.lang.Class,java.lang.reflect.Method)\">构造函数</a>的参数的测试在当前环境中是否已<em>启用</em>，该环境配置通过 <a href=\"../../../annotation/IfProfileValue.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.annotation\"><code>@IfProfileValue</code></a> 注解进行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct a new <code>ProfileValueChecker</code> statement.",
      "translation": "构建一个新的<code>ProfileValueChecker</code>语句。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>next</code> - the next <code>Statement</code> in the execution chain;\nnever <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>next</code> - 执行链中的下一个 <code>Statement</code>；\n永远不为 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>testMethod</code> - the test method to check; may be <code>null</code> if\nthis <code>ProfileValueChecker</code> is being applied at the class level",
      "translation": "`testMethod` - 要检查的测试方法；如果此 `ProfileValueChecker` 是在类级别应用的，则可能为 `<code>null</code>`",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>testClass</code> - the test class to check; never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>testClass</code> - 要检查的测试类；绝不可能是 <code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/AssumptionViolatedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit\">AssumptionViolatedException</a></code> - if the test is disabled",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/AssumptionViolatedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit\">AssumptionViolatedException</a></code> - 如果测试被禁用",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Throwable</a></code> - if evaluation of the next statement fails",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Throwable</a></code> - 如果下一条语句的评估失败",
      "count": 2
